WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
<b><font color='#000000'>Welcome to the FDOrganizer.</font></b>

2
00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:05.333
<b><font color='#000000'>You are currently on the start page of a pre-ingest tool</font></b>

3
00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.333
<b><font color='#000000'>that will help you to prepare your research data</font></b>

4
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:11.750
<b><font color='#000000'>for the long term availability in the best possible way.</font></b>

5
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.791
<b><font color='#000000'>To get started, switch to the Editor tab. </font></b>

6
00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:18.000
<b><font color='#000000'>Here you can collect and merge your data from different sources,</font></b>

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.416
<b><font color='#000000'>such as external databases or electronic lab notebooks.</font></b>

8
00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:25.000
<b><font color='#000000'>You can also structure or curate your data and </font></b>

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.500
<b><font color='#000000'>add further relevant metadata.</font></b>

10
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.583
<b><font color='#000000'>In the third tab, the archive tab, </font></b>

11
00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:32.458
<b><font color='#000000'>you can add the necessary legal information and have</font></b>

12
00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:35.583
<b><font color='#000000'>your data package reviewed by a data curator.</font></b>

13
00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:38.625
<b><font color='#000000'>If you are registered as a data curator,</font></b>

14
00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:41.958
<b><font color='#000000'>you will find another tab, the review tab. </font></b>

15
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.041
<b><font color='#000000'>This is where you can check the data packages and, </font></b>

16
00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:48.458
<b><font color='#000000'>if necessary, give some feedback to the data provider</font></b>

17
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:53.250
<b><font color='#000000'>before you can submit the data to the long-term archiving system.</font></b>

18
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:58.000
<b><font color='#000000'>Please refer to the individual steps for more information on the exact procedure.</font></b>

